p-0 left-0 w-full h-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 via-amber-400 to-blue-600\"></div><h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold mb-6 uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400\">Time until the draw</h3><div class=\"text-slate-900\"><div class=\"h-24 w-full animate-pulse bg-white/20 rounded-xl\"></div></div><p class=\"mt-6 text-xs text-slate-500 font-bold\">Winnings transferred the very next working day!</p></div></header><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-10 border-2 border-slate-200 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.08)] relative group hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform\"><div class=\"absolute top-8 right-8 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-800 bg-blue-100 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[10px]\">Monthly</div><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-2 text-slate-900\">Standard Draw</h2><div class=\"text-5xl font-black tracking-tight mb-8 text-blue-600 drop-shadow-sm\">£10,000</div><div class=\"space-y-5 mb-10 text-slate-600 font-medium\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 bg-blue-50 p-1.5 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-ticket text-blue-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9a3 3 0 0 1 0 6v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2a3 3 0 0 1 0-6V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M13 5v2\"></path><path d=\"M13 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M13 11v2\"></path></svg></div><p>£1 per ticket entry into the primary draw.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 bg-green-50 p-1.5 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar text-green-500\" aria-hidden=\"